    <param.description>GenshinDMG Simulator is an unofficial MATLAB-based analytical application for modeling and comparing Genshin Impact damage scenarios.

It supports character damage simulation, artifact and stat comparison, team buff evaluation, reaction-related calculations, and build optimization workflows. The app is intended for theorycrafting, educational analysis, and personal build planning.

This project is fan-made and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by HoYoverse.</param.description>
